,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1061.649171509,"data":"RESULT_JSON::{\"example_id\": \"DAPT01EVAL-002\", \"arm\": \"dapt_norag\", \"question\": \"According to Stevenson's Notes on Modern Jainism, what is Karma, and how does it affect a person's lives?\", \"answer\": \"According to Stevenson's Notes on Modern Jainism, Karma is a force that binds souls to the material world, preventing them from achieving liberation. It is a consequence of actions and thoughts, creating a cycle of birth and death. The soul's experiences in different lives are determined by its accumulated karma, which influences its current circumstances and future rebirths. The ultimate goal is to break free from this cycle by understanding and eliminating the causes of karma.\", \"prompt_style\": \"chat_template\", \"system_prompt\": \"You are a careful assistant for Jain studies. Answer the user's question concisely (in 1-3 sentences). If you are unsure or the information is not available, say so.\", \"decoding\": \"greedy\", \"max_new_tokens\": 192, \"new_tokens\": 90, \"decode_seconds\": 15.29, \"seed\": 42, \"rag\": false, \"input_prompt_sha256\": \"171ca062f3a8c052512952ee89bb2d66111396cfef7560e9eeeb378df2d4c0c9\"}\n"}
